DESCRIPTION:Home Appraisal Bias Program\n\n<p>Join the City of Philadelphia
 's Home Appraisal Program and industry partners for the inaugural <strong>
 <strong>Appraisal &amp\; Assessment Career Exploration Expo</strong></stro
 ng>\, a unique opportunity to learn about rewarding careers in property va
 luation\, assessment\, real estate\, and related fields.</p><p>This intera
 ctive event will bring together appraisers\, assessors\, educational insti
 tutions\, government agencies\, housing organizations\, lenders\, and indu
 stry leaders to introduce students\, career changers\, and professionals t
 o the many pathways available within the valuation profession.</p>
LOCATION:1755 N 13th St\, Philadelphia\, PA 19122\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Appraiser and Assessor Career Expo
