DESCRIPTION:OPS Kensington Events\n\n<p>NKCDC has weekly Drop-In Center is 
 a safe\, judgment-free space to come as you are. You can grab coffee and f
 ood\, play games\, and connect with people who understand what you’re go
 ing through.</p><p>If you’ve been caught up in street life\, recently ca
 me home\, or just need real support and a place to stay grounded—you bel
 ong here.</p><p>We can connect you to: </p><ul><li>Housing and utility as
 sistance </li><li>ID and personal documents </li><li>Employment opportun
 ities</li><li>Legal support</li><li>Food &amp\; Clothing</li></ul><p>Stop 
 by for an intake and see how we can support you and your needs.</p><p>Cont
 act Cure Violence at 215-427-0350</p>
LOCATION:3000 Kensington Ave\, Philadelphia\, PA 19134\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cure Violence Kensington Friday Drop-In Hours
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:OPS Kensington Events
DTSTAMP:20261111T195516Z
END:VEVENT
