DESCRIPTION:OPS Kensington Events\n\n<br><p>The Kensington Business Coaliti
 on is a group of local business owners who are committed to the growth and
  safety of Kensington. Monthly meetings bring together business owners\, c
 ity officials\, police\, business service providers\, and community partne
 rs. Meetings include discussion on issues facing local business\, informat
 ion on assistance programs for business owners\, and opportunities to inte
 ract with police. </p><p>Interpretation is available as needed. Any busin
 ess owner is welcome to attend! </p>
