DESCRIPTION:OPS Kensington Events\n\n<p>East Kensington Neighbors Associati
 on meets on the third Monday of every month to relay community news\, crim
 e reports\, grant proposals and other updates. June and July meetings are 
 held at Circle of Hope\, 2007 Frankford Avenue. There is no meeting in Aug
 ust. </p><ul><li>6:15 PM Doors open</li><li>7:00 PM Meeting begins</li><l
 i>8:30 PM Meeting adjourns </li></ul><p>Live streaming is available to EK
 NA members who are unable to attend. Email <a href="mailto:secretary@ekna
 .org" target="_blank">secretary@ekna.org</a> for residency verification a
 nd instructions.</p>
