DESCRIPTION:Love Park events\n\nWhat better day to get married in Love? Cou
 ples exchange vows on the day of the year dedicated to Love under iconic L
 OVE sculpture with support from Parks &amp\; Recreation staff and offician
 ts from <a href="https://journeysoftheheart.org/" target="_blank"><u>Journ
 eys of the Heart</u></a>. We ask that visitors respect this special day an
 d keep noise to a minimum during ceremonies.  <br><br><b>Want to get mar
 ried or renew your vows in Love Park?</b><br><br><a href="https://www.phil
 a.gov/services/birth-marriage-life-events/marriage-and-divorce/get-married
 -in-love-park/" target="_blank"><u><u>Click here to learn more and request
  your date.</u></u></a>
