DESCRIPTION:Love Park events\n\n<p>Mural Arts Fest takes over Love Park thi
 s Halloween!</p><p>On <strong><b>Saturday\, October 31\, from 12–5 PM</b
 ></strong>\, Mural Arts Philadelphia brings the city together for an after
 noon packed with art\, music\, creativity\, and Halloween fun. Come ready 
 to make\, move\, play\, and celebrate with live performances\, interactive
  art experiences\, local artists\, community partners\, and plenty of surp
 rises along the way at our annual festival.</p><p>Decorate your own mask\,
  create and trade affirmations\, get a custom airbrushed tote bag\, paint 
 your best pumpkin for a chance to win a cash prize\, and take on inflatabl
 e games and other family-friendly activities. Explore an artist vendor mar
 ket and community resource tables\, get your face painted\, and experience
  live performances from local artists including <strong><b>Ryan Gilfillan<
 /b></strong>\, with sound by <strong><b>Club Advisory</b></strong> and mor
 e to come.</p><p>Whether you’re showing up in costume\, coming with frie
 nds and family\, or just looking for something fun to do in the heart of t
 he city\, <strong><b>Mural Arts Fest is where art and Philly energy collid
 e.</b></strong></p>
LOCATION:JFK Plaza (Love Park)\, 1501 John F Kennedy Blvd\, Philadelphia\, 
 PA 19102\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Mural Arts Fest
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:Love Park events
DTSTAMP:20261111T195516Z
END:VEVENT
