 arget="_blank">FCM Hospitality</a> will be back for a third season\, the l
 ongest to date\, running for 23 weeks from April 25 through September 30.K
 icking off at the Azalea Garden at noon on April 25\, each week Parks on T
 ap will travel to a different Philadelphia park on a Wednesday and stay th
 rough Sunday\, offering a barbecue-inspired menu with rotating seasonal fo
 od and beer specials in a family-friendly setting. All Parks on Tap locati
 ons will include seating and tables\, games\, restrooms\, and a menu of ho
 t food\, salads\, and snacks. </span>
