DESCRIPTION:Philadelphia Parks & Recreation subcalendar\n\nSunrise Fitness 
 Hikes<br>Wednesdays | 7 a.m. | Teens &amp\; Adults. FREE.<br>Take a mid-we
 ek break to greet the sun\, clear your mind\, and get your heart rate up.<
 br>We hike 4+ miles at a &lt\;20 minute mile pace.<br>Meet at PEC (Unless 
 otherwise stated.)<br><br>Everything is subject to change. Register for up
 dates.<br>Information at <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://ww
 w.facebook.com/ExplorePEC?__cft__%5B0%5D%3DAZU6AJ8ePKCi6hGsUBmSWczlOYTIt34
 FNZhwfBhQ_v6kHTDtcCrx48tFcZfIKgmfy_NhK-gMGDDs2Iude1WjlnYkXDZ_tv04XbmoexgqP
 f9nU4re0OlMQmFSmTRT2ZhDzfQ-sOREqPPrTQK3oQiGuKo8%26__tn__%3Dq&amp\;sa=D&amp
 \;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3D9QoVa6UuUvDXDIRUj5aK" target
 ="_blank"><u>Facebook.com/ExplorePEC</u></a>\, <a href="mailto:pec@phila.g
 ov" target="_blank"><u>pec@phila.gov</u></a>\, or 215.685.0470.<br>Registr
 ation is important because hike locations may vary or weather may change h
 ikes.<br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://forms.gle/vjKVxGzF9
 GoSy9zX7?fbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExaUdEaGJWMTc3WldXeHpXNgEeWENU3R
 qHh_7jD9msjTFy3ClO2BsqiOLsxqzgpVxHJZXRdPlHUI44mIWfSOI_aem_aQdkOyO5sGGAvtPa
 cxuD2Q&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3ylaNGvHJd
 W_Z-zHt3DOFt" target="_blank"><u>https://forms.gle/vjKVxGzF9GoSy9zX7</u></
 a><br><br>Come every week or some weeks. We are happy to have you any time
  we see you. Please do not hesitate to join to see if this is right for yo
 u.<br><br><ul><li><p>All locations have parking lots.</p></li><li><p>Natur
 e Sanctuary or Pennypack= Pennypack Environmental Center\, 8600A Verree Rd
  19115</p></li><li><p>Champions Park Playground\, 910 Tustin St\, Philadel
 phia\, PA 19111</p></li><li><p>Pine Road or Pine Road Parking Area 1\, 863
 9 Pine Rd 19111</p></li><li><p>Krewstown Road\, 8451 Krewstown Rd 19115</p
 ></li><li><p>Everything is subject to change as life happens. Registration
  is recommended to stay up-to-date as the year progresses.</p></li></ul><b
 r><br>PLEASE NOTE:<br>Anyone selling tickets is a scammer. Unsure? Send us
  a quick email at <a href="mailto:pec@phila.gov" target="_blank"><u><u>pe
 c@phila.gov</u></u></a>.<br><br>Everything is subject to change. Register 
 to stay up-to-date.<br><br>We can not predict the appearances of specific 
 wildlife\, full moon\, etc.\, however\, you can expect an enjoyable experi
 ence in nature.<br><br>Programs are outdoors in all-weather. We recommend 
 dressing for the weather\, physical activity\, and ticks. We encourage wea
 ring tick repellant and doing a thorough tick check after outdoor adventur
 es.<br><br>The center\, bathrooms\, and picnic areas are all accessible\, 
 however\, the trails are rocky and uneven.<br><br>Free parking in the Cent
 er&#39\;s lot and street parking along Verree Road. There is a short walk 
 on the paved surface from the parking lot to the Center.
LOCATION:8639 Pine Rd\, Philadelphia\, PA 19111\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sunrise Fitness Hike at Pine Road Parking
TRANSP:OPAQUE
