DESCRIPTION:Philadelphia Parks & Recreation subcalendar\n\nMeet at Anna C. 
 Verna Playground (at the picnic tables)\n\n🌿 Nature Craft and Activitie
 s Table 🌿\nCreate. Play. Learn.\nJoin us every 2nd and 4th Saturday for
  a fun-filled day of creativity and exploration! Our Nature Craft and Acti
 vities Table offers a unique opportunity for individuals of all ages to en
 gage with the natural world through hands-on crafts and exciting activitie
 s. Whether you&#39\;re a budding artist\, a nature enthusiast\, or simply 
 looking for a delightful way to spend your weekend\, our sessions are desi
 gned to inspire and educate. Gather your friends and family and come join 
 the fun! All ages are welcome\, and we can&#39\;t wait to create with you.
  🌼✨\nBrought to you by The Friends of FDR Park
LOCATION:FDR Park\, 1500 Pattison Avenue &\, S Broad St\, Philadelphia\, PA
  19145\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Nature Craft and Activity Table - Verna Playground
