DESCRIPTION:Philadelphia Parks & Recreation subcalendar\n\nSunset Stewardsh
 ip<br>Come on down to the park after work! The 3rd Friday of the month fro
 m May through September (except June 12th Friday)<br><p>Meet us at the WEL
 COME CENTER at 1800 Pattison Ave\, the first building on your right as you
  enter the park at 15th street.</p><p>You can call/text 215-479-1954 if yo
 u can&#39\;t find it.</p>5-7pm<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?
 q=https://www.givepulse.com/event/861258-Sunset-Service&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sou
 rce=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2jPPMgfWcn2nuJq_Ythehn" target="_bl
 ank">Sign up here </a>
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sunset Stewardship - 5-7pm
