BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T150000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;WKST=MO;UNTIL=20261121T045959Z;BYDAY=TH
UID:4a17spkott88ola0t21gqrv1a5@google.com
DESCRIPTION:Philadelphia Parks & Recreation subcalendar\n\n<p><span>Registe
 r at </span><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://forms.gle/R1tr7
 aczAnrniDeg6&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3R5i
 RyYaiKbKaT4j3Ik1pK" target="_blank">https://forms.gle/R1tr7aczAnrniDeg6</a
 ><br></p><p><i><b>By signing up you are agreeing to receive weekly reminde
 r emails\, not fully committing to joining each week. </b>When you receiv
 e the reminder email\, you can then respond with whether or not you will b
 e joining us that week. Come to one\, some\, or all garden days. Whatever
  works for you\,</i></p><p>Join other gardeners throughout the growing sea
 son as we tend to the Verree House Herb Garden and the immediate land arou
 nd the center\, including the meadow and beach below the Center</p><p>Thro
 ughout the season we will plan\, weed\, plant\, weed\, harvest\, weed\, sh
 are\, weed\, and eventually put the gardens to bed.  </p><p>Volunteers w
 ill be able to take home any harvest\, when available.  We will also have
  small gardening workshops\, and larger restoration/clean-up days along th
 e way.</p><p>This is best for older children\, teens and adults interested
  in learning while getting dirty. Adults must supervise their children.  
  <br></p><p>April-Summer Solstice: Thursdays 1-3 p.m.<br></p><p>Summer: 
 Thursdays 8-10 a.m.<br></p><p>Autumn Equinox-Halloween:  Thursdays 1-3 p
 .m.</p><p>FREE.</p><p>Questions? <a href="mailto:PEC@phila.gov" target="_b
 lank">PEC@phila.gov</a> or 215.685.0470. </p>
LOCATION:Pennypack Environmental Center\, 8600A Verree Rd\, Philadelphia\, 
 PA 19115\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Garden Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:Philadelphia Parks & Recreation subcalendar
DTSTAMP:20261111T195516Z
END:VEVENT
