RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYDAY=4WE
UID:2vu3heqq0h4lucpfknapb6drm9_R20260923T223000@google.com
DESCRIPTION:Substance Use Prevention and Harm Reduction\n\nRegister at htt
 ps://redcap.phila.gov/surveys/?s=A7FELKJWED.\n\nLosing a partner to substa
 nce use can leave a deep and lasting ache shadowed by a range of feelings 
 such as confusion\, anger\, shame\, loneliness\, and relief. While this gr
 ief can be uniquely challenging\, the good news is that you don’t have t
 o walk this journey alone.\n\nJoin a compassionate and safe space to conne
 ct and heal with others. What to Expect:\n- Open\, nonjudgmental conversat
 ion\n- Supportive community and shared stories\n- Gentle guidance and spac
 e to grieve your own way\n\nFor more information or to register\, contact 
 Talia Jones\, MS attalia.jones@phila.gov or via call/text at 856-823-1775.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Navigating Partner Loss: Grief Support Group
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:Substance Use Prevention and Harm Reduction
