BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T113000
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYDAY=2TU
UID:547l5o97fd1moudn788h3kv043_R20260908T143000@google.com
DESCRIPTION:Substance Use Prevention and Harm Reduction\n\nRegister here: 
 https://redcap.phila.gov/surveys/?s=A7FELKJWED\n\nJoin us for a gentle sta
 rt to your day with warmth\, understanding\, and shared healing. Whether y
 our grief is recent or long held\, this drop-in group is a safe and suppor
 tive space to navigate loss and find comfort in community. There is no pre
 ssure to speak\, just grab your cup of coffee and come as you are. Contact
  Talia Jones\, MS\, for questions at 856-823-1775 or talia.jones@phila.gov
 .
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Morning Brew Grief Support Group
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CATEGORIES:Substance Use Prevention and Harm Reduction
DTSTAMP:20261111T195516Z
END:VEVENT
