 gb(255\,255\,255)\; margin:0px\; font-family:&quot\;Open Sans&quot\;\; fon
 t-size:12pt">\n<span style="color:rgb(0\,0\,0)">This course is mandatory f
 or&nbsp\;new City employees/officers and those who have not yet attended e
 thics training. The Philadelphia Code requires all City employees and offi
 cers to receive ethics training\, which is provided by the\n Philadelphia 
 Board of Ethics.<br>\n<br>\nThis course also fulfils the new mandatory&nbs
 p\;routine ethics training requirement for existing City employees and off
 icers per\n</span><span style="color:rgb(15\,77\,144)\; font-weight:700"><
 u><a href="https://www.phila.gov/media/20241121090750/BOE-regulation-7.pdf
 " data-linkindex="0" title="https://www.phila.gov/media/20241121090750/BOE
 -regulation-7.pdf" class="x_x_OWAAutoLink" id="OWA5452b626-1912-7bcc-7680-
 c58f60988b72" style="color:rgb(15\,77\,144)\; margin:0px\; text-align:left
 ">Board\n of Ethics Regulation No. 7</a></u></span><span style="color:rgb(
 0\,0\,0)">. The rollout of this new training mandate is based on start yea
 r with the City\, as follows:</span></div>\n<ul style="text-align:left\; m
 argin:0px 0px 1rem 1.25rem\; padding-left:2rem\; list-style-position:outsi
 de\; list-style-type:disc\; background-color:rgb(255\,255\,255)">\n<li cla
 ss="elementToProof" style="font-family:&quot\;Open Sans&quot\;\; font-size
 :12pt\; color:rgb(0\,0\,0)\; margin:0px">\nGroup A: start years ending in 
 0 and 5 must get training in 2025 and every year thereafter ending in 0 an
 d 5&nbsp\;</li><li class="elementToProof" style="font-family:&quot\;Open S
 ans&quot\;\; font-size:12pt\; color:rgb(0\,0\,0)\; margin:0px">\n<b>Group 
 B:&nbsp\;start years&nbsp\;ending in 1 and 6 must get training in 2026 and
  every year thereafter ending in 1 and 6&nbsp\;</b></li><li class="element
 ToProof" style="font-family:&quot\;Open Sans&quot\;\; font-size:12pt\; col
 or:rgb(0\,0\,0)\; margin:0px">\nGroup C:&nbsp\;start years&nbsp\;ending in
  2 and 7 must get training in 2027 and every year thereafter ending in 2 a
 nd 7&nbsp\;</li><li class="elementToProof" style="font-family:&quot\;Open 
 Sans&quot\;\; font-size:12pt\; color:rgb(0\,0\,0)\; margin:0px">\nGroup D:
 &nbsp\;start years&nbsp\;ending in 3 and 8 must get training in 2028 and e
 very year thereafter ending in 3 and 8&nbsp\;</li><li class="elementToProo
 f" style="font-family:&quot\;Open Sans&quot\;\; font-size:12pt\; color:rgb
 (0\,0\,0)\; margin:0px">\nGroup E:&nbsp\;start years&nbsp\;ending in 4 and
  9 must get training in 2029 and every year thereafter ending in 4 and 9&n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;</li></ul>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align:left
 \; text-indent:0px\; background-color:rgb(255\,255\,255)\; margin:0px\; fo
 nt-family:&quot\;Open Sans&quot\;\; font-size:12pt">\n<span style="color:r
 gb(0\,0\,0)">Register at </span><span style="color:rgb(15\,77\,144)\; font
 -weight:700"><u><a href="https://ethics.pub/GETraining" data-linkindex="1"
  title="https://ethics.pub/GETraining" class="x_x_OWAAutoLink" id="OWAfb89
 1b5c-68f3-457f-b26c-eeb7ac998b66" style="color:rgb(15\,77\,144)\; margin:0
 px\; text-align:left">ethics.pub/GETraining</a></u></span></div>\n<div cla
 ss="elementToProof" style="text-align:left\; text-indent:0px\; background-
