DESCRIPTION:Philadelphia Historical Commission\n\nThe Historical Commission
  will hold its Friday\, November 13\, 2026 meeting in person at 1515 Arch 
 Street\, 18th Floor\, Room 18-029. Applicants\, property owners\, and the 
 public may attend the meeting in person at 1515 Arch Street\, or remotely 
 on the Zoom platform using your computer\, tablet\, smartphone\, or teleph
 one. <br><br>The meeting agenda\, applications\, nomination materials\, an
 d recent meeting minutes are available on the Historical Commission's <a h
 ref="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww
 .phila.gov%2Fdepartments%2Fphiladelphia-historical-commission%2Fpublic-mee
 tings%2F&amp\;data=05%7C02%7Ckim.chantry%40phila.gov%7Cbda934242e2147326da
