 br><br><br><b>Group Description: </b>A 10-week habilitation structured you
 th support group for incarcerated youth\, ages 12-18. The purpose of B.E.A
 .M is to help adolescent males who are incarcerated to individually thrive
  by empowering and enhancing their coping skills\, identifying trauma and 
 utilizing prosocial behaviors so that they can respond effectively to disa
 ppointment\, rejection\, anger\, and the challenges of parenting inside an
 d beyond institutional walls.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
