DESCRIPTION:Department of Revenue\n\nThe Real Estate Tax Installment Plan a
 llows qualifying homeowners to pay current-year property taxes in monthly 
 installments.<br><br>You must submit an application by March 31. This prog
 ram has income guidelines for property owners under 64 years old. Seniors 
 65+ qualify regardless of income. Applicants must own and live on the prop
 erty.<br><br>The easiest and quickest way to apply is online through the P
