DESCRIPTION:Department of Revenue\n\nHomestead's deadline is December 1 of 
 each year. Early applicants should apply by October 1 to see approval refl
 ected on their Real Estate Tax bill for the following year.<br><p>Starting
  in 2025\, this exemption reduces the property’s assessed value by $100\
 ,000. Most homeowners save up $1\,399 a year on their Real Estate Tax bill
 .</p><p>Applications are accepted by mail\, in person\, and online through
  the Philadelphia Tax Center at <a href="https://tax-services.phila.gov/_
 /" target="_blank">https://tax-services.phila.gov/</a><br><br>Questions? C
 all the Homestead hotline (215) 686-9200</p>You can find detailed informat
 ion at: www.phila.gov/Homestead
