DESCRIPTION:Department of Revenue\n\n<p>Use and Occupancy Tax must be filed
  and paid monthly on the 25th of each month. Qualifying taxpayers may file
  and pay yearly by January 25th. If the 25th falls on a weekend or holiday
 \, the return is due on the first business day after the 25th. </p><p>Tax
 payers <b>must file and pay</b> the Use and Occupancy Tax electronically
  on the Philadelphia Tax Center. We no longer accept coupons or mailed che
 cks.</p><p>A previously available exemption was eliminated effective 2026.
 </p><p>Find more info at <a href="https://www.phila.gov/services/payments
 -assistance-taxes/taxes/business-taxes/business-taxes-by-type/use-occupanc
 y-tax/" target="_blank">https://www.phila.gov/services/payments-assistance
 -taxes/taxes/business-taxes/business-taxes-by-type/use-occupancy-tax/</a><
 /p>
